---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="about-page">
    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="about-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT IMPACT FESTIVAL</p>

        <h1>
          MORE THAN<br />
          JUST A FESTIVAL
        </h1>

        <p class="intro-text">Impact Festival brings people together through music, art, talks, workshops and food. The festival creates a space where people can meet, share ideas and take part in experiences focused on community, culture and positive change.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="text-block">
        <h2>ABOUT THE FESTIVAL</h2>

        <p>Impact Festival takes place at Trifolium in Copenhagen and combines culture, music and activities in one festival experience.</p>

        <p>The festival is built around participation. Visitors can experience live music, art, talks and workshops while also meeting new people and becoming part of the community around the festival.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="media-block">
        <video controls>
          <source src="/videos/pov.MP4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section reverse">
      <div class="media-block">
        <video controls>
          <source src="/videos/vlog.MP4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
      </div>

      <div class="text-block">
        <h2>COMMUNITY & IMPACT</h2>

        <p>Community is an important part of Impact Festival. The festival creates a place where people can meet, participate and experience something together.</p>

        <p>Through talks, workshops, art, music and shared experiences, the festival creates space for new ideas, conversations and connections.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="video-section">
      <div class="video-title">
        <h2>EXPERIENCE THE FESTIVAL</h2>

        <p>Get a feeling of the atmosphere, people and experiences at Impact Festival.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="large-video">
        <video controls>
          <source src="/videos/about-video-2.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="program-section">
      <div class="program-text">
        <h2>THE PROGRAM</h2>

        <p>The program includes music, art, talks, workshops and food. Visitors can explore different activities throughout the festival and create their own festival experience.</p>

        <p>The program makes it easy to see what is happening during the festival and choose which experiences you want to take part in.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="program-poster">
        <img src="/poster.png" alt="Impact Festival program" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="trifolium-section">
      <div class="trifolium-image">
        <img src="/logoer.png" alt="Trifolium" />
      </div>

      <div class="trifolium-text">
        <h2>IMPACT FESTIVAL & TRIFOLIUM</h2>
        <p>Impact Festival is connected to Trifolium. The festival brings people together around culture, community and positive change.</p>

        <p>Through Impact Festival, visitors can experience Trifolium and learn more about the ideas and community behind the place.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    width: 100%;
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  }

  .about-hero {
    min-height: 700px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 100px 7% 50px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .about-intro {
    max-width: 1100px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 25px;
    color: #ed0b15;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(60px, 7vw, 120px);
    line-height: 0.82;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .intro-text {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 60px 0 0;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .content-section {
    width: 86%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 70px 0;

    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 100px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .content-section.reverse {
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
  }

  .text-block h2,
  .video-title h2,
  .program-text h2,
  .trifolium-section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 35px;
    font-size: clamp(45px, 5vw, 80px);
    line-height: 0.95;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .text-block p,
  .program-text p,
  .trifolium-section p,
  .video-title p {
    max-width: 650px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .media-block {
    width: 100%;
    height: 550px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #eee;
  }

  .media-block img,
  .media-block video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  /* STOR VIDEO */

  .video-section {
    width: 86%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 120px 0;
  }

  .video-title {
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .large-video {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    background: #111;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .large-video video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .program-section {
    width: 86%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 120px 0;

    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 120px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .program-poster img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }
  .trifolium-section {
    width: 86%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 80px 0 50px;

    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 100px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .trifolium-image {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .trifolium-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .trifolium-text {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .trifolium-text h2 {
    margin: 0 0 35px;
    font-size: clamp(45px, 5vw, 80px);
    line-height: 0.95;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .trifolium-text p {
    max-width: 650px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .media-block {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    background: white;
    height: auto;
  }

  .media-block video {
    width: auto;
    height: 650px;
    max-width: 100%;
    display: block;
  }
  /* MOBIL */

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-hero {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 80px 20px;
    }

    .about-hero h1 {
      font-size: 60px;
    }

    .intro-text {
      margin-top: 40px;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .content-section,
    .content-section.reverse,
    .program-section {
      width: calc(100% - 40px);
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 50px;
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .media-block {
      height: 400px;
    }

    .video-section,
    .trifolium-section {
      width: calc(100% - 40px);
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .text-block h2,
    .video-title h2,
    .program-text h2,
    .trifolium-section h2 {
      font-size: 46px;
    }
  }
</style>
